    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Sora, are you ready yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop rushing me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Urgh... This dress is so tight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You haven't been chubbing up on pizza behind my back, have you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you even talking about? I only had <i>one</i> extra slice last night!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sora, suck it in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hissss\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alrighty! Perfect!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Done? Come on out already and let me see!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Coming, coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#9$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wooooah, you look amazing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'n say that again. One purdy lady!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heehee.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... If only Texas was here to see you too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew you had it in ya though, Sora. Ya made it onstage here in Siracusa mighty quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But of course~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time, 'La Morte di Texas' will be presented in multiple acts. We've already finished rehearsing the first one, and the opening night is the day after tomorrow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "If everything goes well, maybe she'll be the one looking for me, rather than the other way around~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That could happen. Lemme think... Yeah, if it comes to that, I'm definitely gonna buy a pizza to slap her face around a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speakin' of Texas, I've been talkin' up the Bellone family. I hear tell things've been awful rough for 'em lately. Hope that ain't gettin' in her way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's gonna be perfectly fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Most we'n do right now is keep the faith in her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We oughta rest up before Sora's debut too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I originally wanted to take a look around the city, but it feels like I've turned into Sora's bodyguard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bite me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But hey, I've eaten my weight in the free food at the theater. Hehe, their pizza's not half bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Things are probably only gonna get busier from here on out, so let's go for a walk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, did you hear...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Actress"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're talking... Tex... right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meddlesome Actress"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, Texas... sentenced...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Actress"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ehh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
