    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#9$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, did you just say something about Texas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yup, sure did. You interested?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Actress"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened to Texas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175"
    },
    {
        "text": "My boyfriend's with Famiglia Bellone, and I heard it from him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Actress"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know how il Ministro dei Lavori Pubblici was killed a few days ago?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Actress"
    },
    {
        "text": "Apparently, they found the culprit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Actress"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one who did it was the last of the Texas bloodline. I think her name was Cellinia or something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Actress"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "No way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175"
    },
    {
        "text": "They even decided on the court date. It's the day after tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Actress"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
